flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Read user ID]
    B --> C{Empty?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Show error]
    C -- No --> E[Create ValidationService]
    E --> F{User ID valid?}
    F -- No --> G[Show invalid ID]
    F -- Yes --> H{User exists?}
    H -- No --> I[Show missing user]
    H -- Yes --> J[Enable editable fields and save button]
    J --> K[Load sample values into fields]
    K --> L[Show sample loaded success]
    D --> M[End]
    G --> M
    I --> M
    L --> M
